{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "皆さ、こんにちは。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-1", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-1", "timestamp": 1783475973.0148144}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "第二回目のビジネス会話クラスの授業、お疲れ様でした。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-2", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-2", "timestamp": 1783475976.4644742}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "から第二回の復習ビデオを始めたいと思います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-3", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-3", "timestamp": 1783475987.7143967}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "それではよろしくお願いしますではまず今回の表現を復習しましょう。今回の表現は2つありました。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-4", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-4", "timestamp": 1783475992.9817939}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "一つ目、他社の人に挨拶する表現です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-5", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-5", "timestamp": 1783475997.752959}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "表現はお世話になっております。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-6", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-6", "timestamp": 1783476001.8247306}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "表現を使うんでしたね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-7", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-7", "timestamp": 1783476006.7858188}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "に、もっと丁寧に言う場合、どうでしたか。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-8", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-8", "timestamp": 1783476009.6660511}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "いつもお世話になっております。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-9", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-9", "timestamp": 1783476014.7191174}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "お世話になっておりますの前にいつもという言葉を付け足すと、さらに丁寧になると思います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-10", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-10", "timestamp": 1783476022.4675918}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "は普段皆さんが挨拶、直接挨拶する場面やメールの場面でもよく使ったり見たりすることが多いと思います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-11", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-11", "timestamp": 1783476032.2525115}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "二つ目の表現は、他の人を紹介する場合です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-12", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-12", "timestamp": 1783476036.7537217}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "前回は自分の名前を紹介する自己紹介でしたが、今回は他の人、他社を紹介する他社紹介になります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-13", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-13", "timestamp": 1783476048.308879}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "は、自分の会社の人をお客様に紹介する場合です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-14", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-14", "timestamp": 1783476058.041019}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "自社の人の名前でございます。の表現を使います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-15", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-15", "timestamp": 1783476063.5043228}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "営業部長の永井でございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-16", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-16", "timestamp": 1783476069.721269}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "次、今度は他社の人のことを紹介します。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-17", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-17", "timestamp": 1783476088.949973}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "自分の会社の人に他社の人、つまりお客様を紹介する場面です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-18", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-18", "timestamp": 1783476092.560077}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "他社の人の名前さまでいらっしゃいます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-19", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-19", "timestamp": 1783476096.9280562}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "例。こちらはX社の開発部長の江藤様でいらっしゃいます二つの場面表現も異なりますね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-20", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-20", "timestamp": 1783476117.1621711}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "自分の会社の人は身内なのでございます。そして注意するポイントがありますね。この名前の部分です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-21", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-21", "timestamp": 1783476129.4142854}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "他社の人に自社の人を紹介する場合自社の人にはさんや役職名はつけないこれがポイントです。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-22", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-22", "timestamp": 1783476143.6108754}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "の場合は永井、な、自分にとって部長の永井部長を他社の人に紹介する場合", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-23", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-23", "timestamp": 1783476152.3402486}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "他社の人が一番目上の立場になるのでこの永井さんでございます", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-24", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-24", "timestamp": 1783476161.8505147}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "永井部長でございます。この表現は使いません。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-25", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-25", "timestamp": 1783476165.982772}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "前に、部長の永井でございます役職名がなかった場合は永井でございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-26", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-26", "timestamp": 1783476174.9539433}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "というふうに紹介します。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-27", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-27", "timestamp": 1783476179.554485}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "次、他社の人の名前を紹介する場合こは必ず様、またはさんでもいいと思います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-28", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-28", "timestamp": 1783476191.5799212}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "何々さん何々様、これを絶対忘れないように注意してくださいでは談話で練習しいきましょう。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-29", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-29", "timestamp": 1783476200.862775}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "は2。他社の人に挨拶をする場面での談話です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-30", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-30", "timestamp": 1783476210.2714827}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "では、リピートしてください御社を担当させていただきます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-31", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-31", "timestamp": 1783476216.290005}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "オリエンタル商事のAでございますどうどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-32", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-32", "timestamp": 1783476224.263211}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "Aさですか。いつもお世話になっております。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-33", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-33", "timestamp": 1783476230.0608394}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "営業部のBでございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-34", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-34", "timestamp": 1783476236.3977597}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "こちらこそどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-35", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-35", "timestamp": 1783476239.6554103}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "では内容を確認したいと思います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-36", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-36", "timestamp": 1783476248.8948839}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "今回はaは新しい担当者として挨拶をしている場面ですね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-37", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-37", "timestamp": 1783476249.3345613}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "御社、これはお客様の会社、あなたの会社にあります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-38", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-38", "timestamp": 1783476262.4403746}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "あなたの会社を担当させていただきます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-39", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-39", "timestamp": 1783476269.4222634}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "これは自分が担当するの丁寧は使役形プラスでいただきます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-40", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-40", "timestamp": 1783476276.9314508}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "は自分の好意を丁寧に相手に伝えてる、伝える場面に使う表現です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-41", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-41", "timestamp": 1783476285.9803584}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "ばこちらで待たせていただきますで待ちますではなくて、ここで待たせていただきます", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-42", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-42", "timestamp": 1783476286.8606021}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "だと丁寧に自分の行為を相手に報告しています。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-43", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-43", "timestamp": 1783476294.8288252}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "し注意点があります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-44", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-44", "timestamp": 1783476299.3873072}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "動詞のて形いただきます。これだとその行為は相手になってしまいます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-45", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-45", "timestamp": 1783476304.9113963}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "担当していただきますだと相手に依頼する表現になってしまうのでここは注意が必要です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-46", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-46", "timestamp": 1783476314.7793324}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "自分の行為の場合は使役でいただきますを使いましょう。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-47", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-47", "timestamp": 1783476321.9565558}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "次の会話は、担当交代の挨拶の会話になります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-48", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-48", "timestamp": 1783476330.8937526}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "では、今回も皆さんリピートしてください。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-49", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-49", "timestamp": 1783476339.091315}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "いつもお世話になっておりますこの度、御社の担当が変わりましたので公認のものを連れてご挨拶に参りました。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-50", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-50", "timestamp": 1783476349.4954047}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "はご丁寧に恐れ入ります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-51", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-51", "timestamp": 1783476354.8171136}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "が私の後任のチン・シュウメイでございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-52", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-52", "timestamp": 1783476361.696414}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "私同様よろしくお願いいたします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-53", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-53", "timestamp": 1783476368.6276922}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "このたび御社を担当せていただくことになりました。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-54", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-54", "timestamp": 1783476377.6114433}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "チンでございますあ、チンさんですか。木村でございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-55", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-55", "timestamp": 1783476384.682259}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-56", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-56", "timestamp": 1783476388.8999357}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "精一杯がんばりますので、こちらこそよろしくお願いいたします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-57", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-57", "timestamp": 1783476396.6271904}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "ではもう一度内容を確認しましょう。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-58", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-58", "timestamp": 1783476403.2935348}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "は、担当交代の挨拶の会話になります。登場人物は三人。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-59", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-59", "timestamp": 1783476411.956942}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "永井さん木村さん、チンさんの三人になります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-60", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-60", "timestamp": 1783476416.324362}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "は永井さんがいつもお世話になっておりますと会話を始めています", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-61", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-61", "timestamp": 1783476422.6602907}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "が、実はこのたび御社の担当が変わりましたので、後任のものを連れてご挨拶に参りました。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-62", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-62", "timestamp": 1783476439.190112}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "後任これの意味は後の任務者後の担当者ということですね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-63", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-63", "timestamp": 1783476439.4075644}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "後任の者を連れてご挨拶に参りました。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-64", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-64", "timestamp": 1783476447.4825187}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "ですからつまり永井さんは前任者、今まで担当していた人ということになります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-65", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-65", "timestamp": 1783476454.788044}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "は新しい担当者、後の任務者の人を連れて一緒に二人で挨拶に来たという場面ですね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-66", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-66", "timestamp": 1783476462.7764573}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "に対して木村さんが、それはご丁寧に恐れ入ります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-67", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-67", "timestamp": 1783476471.4030976}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "これはすみませんの丁寧ですね。すみませんの謙譲語になります。恐れ入ります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-68", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-68", "timestamp": 1783476482.0274367}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "わざ挨拶に来てくれたことに対してそれはわざ丁寧に来てくださってありがとうございます。という表現になります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-69", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-69", "timestamp": 1783476492.9468236}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "から永井さん。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-70", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-70", "timestamp": 1783476498.9740696}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "こちらが私の後任の珍習名でございます。私同様よろしくお願いいたします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-71", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-71", "timestamp": 1783476502.918034}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "漢字は私ですが私ともより読みますね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-72", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-72", "timestamp": 1783476513.720335}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "私より私の方がより謙譲語になります。もちろん私でも問題ありません。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-73", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-73", "timestamp": 1783476519.0710018}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "から次、チンさん。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-74", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-74", "timestamp": 1783476525.9497907}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "このたび御社を担当させていただくことになりました。チンでございます。先ほどの談話の表現でもありましたね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-75", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-75", "timestamp": 1783476534.3423033}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "が担当することなので使役形させていただくになります木村さ、あ、チンさんですか。木村でございます。どうぞよろしくお願いします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-76", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-76", "timestamp": 1783476547.1971297}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "精一杯がんばりますので、こちらこそよろしくお願いいたします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-77", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-77", "timestamp": 1783476552.1173587}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "が会話の流れになりますでは最後に改まった表現についてシェアしたいと思います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-78", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-78", "timestamp": 1783476563.451296}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "改まった表現とは、日常会話の表現に比べて、より丁寧な表現になります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-79", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-79", "timestamp": 1783476572.4784546}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "仕事の場面や目上の人に使う場面にはこの改まった表現を使うことが多くありますね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-80", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-80", "timestamp": 1783476581.323408}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "表をご覧ください。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-81", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-81", "timestamp": 1783476584.596721}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "は時間に関する言葉をピックアップしたんですが、よく話す場合でもメールの場合でも使われる言葉なのでぜひ確認してください", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-82", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-82", "timestamp": 1783476601.3198993}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "に発音して終わりたいと思います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-83", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-83", "timestamp": 1783476605.0987678}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "ではこの改まった表現の発音からやりましょう。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-84", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-84", "timestamp": 1783476614.6880982}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "たび本日明日昨日先日翌日先ほど後ほどいですか", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-85", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-85", "timestamp": 1783476631.6356444}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "もうこれは本当に仕事のメールでも", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-86", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-86", "timestamp": 1783476640.6862104}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.2-20260708-105913-a29715c0", "ui_text": "よく使われる、よく見る表現なのでも、覚えてほしいです。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-87", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-87", "timestamp": 1783476646.4421039}
